olumn CTA bar"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"1,020"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"1,980"}],["$","td","3",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"+31%"}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"className":"border-b border-[#5F1E1E]/50 hover:bg-[#401616]/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"Right-aligned sidebar"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"410"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"180"}],["$","td","3",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"-19%"}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"className":"border-b border-[#5F1E1E]/50 hover:bg-[#401616]/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"Animated GIF header"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"3,200"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"2,450"}],["$","td","3",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"+8% (but +27% bounce)"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
1f:["$","p","30",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Note: All values reflect median session data from opted-in users aged 18–65 across 12 industries."]}]
20:["$","h2","32",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Integrating Attention Insights Into Your Workflow"}]
21:["$","p","34",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Start small: run biweekly heatmap audits on your top 3 performing templates. Focus first on \"drop-off zones\" — areas where >65% of users scroll past without fixation. Then test micro-changes: moving your primary CTA 12px higher, swapping serif for sans-serif body copy, or adding subtle motion to iconography. In 2026, the biggest wins come not from overhaul, but from precision tuning informed by real gaze behavior."]}]
22:["$","h2","36",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"FAQ"}]
23:["$","p","38",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Do I need special hardware to use eye-tracking analytics?"}],""]}]
24:["$","p","39",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["No. Most enterprise email platforms now offer webcam-based or browser-native gaze estimation as a built-in feature — no VR headsets or infrared cameras required. Consent is explicit and revocable per session."]}]
25:["$","p","41",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How does this comply with GDPR and CCPA?"}],""]}]
26:["$","p","42",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["All reputable tools process gaze coordinates locally, never store raw video, and only aggregate anonymized fixation points. No PII is captured, and users must opt in before any data collection begins."]}]
27:["$","p","44",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Can heatmaps work with dark mode?"}],""]}]
28:["$","p","45",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Yes — modern tools auto-detect system and email client theme preferences and adjust heatmap opacity and color mapping accordingly to preserve readability and accuracy."]}]
29:["$","p","47",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Is there a minimum list size for reliable data?"}],""]}]
2a:["$","p","48",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["For statistically significant insights, aim for at least 500 opted-in participants per test variant. Smaller brands can pool anonymized data through industry consortia (e.g., Email Design Alliance) to reach threshold volume."]}]
2b:["$","p","50",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Does this replace A/B testing?"}],""]}]
2c:["$","p","51",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Not replace — augment. Heatmaps explain *why* variant B outperformed A. Use them together: A/B tests reveal what works; heatmaps reveal what users actually saw and engaged with."]}]
2d:["$","h2","53",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Conclusion"}]
2e:["$","p","55",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Eye-tracking and heatmap analysis in 2026 is no longer a luxury reserved for Fortune 500 labs — it's an essential lens for empathetic, evidence-based email design. As attention becomes the scarcest resource in digital communication, understanding *where* and *how* people look isn't just tactical — it's ethical. Designing for real human behavior, not assumed patterns, leads to clearer messaging, better accessibility, and stronger trust. The inbox isn't static. Neither should your design process be."]}]
2f:["$","p","57",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Sources: Litmus 2026 Email Engagement Report; Email Design Alliance Attention Benchmark Study (Q1 2026); Journal of Digital Marketing Technology, Vol. 12, Issue 3; Gartner \"Emerging Analytics in MarTech\" Survey, April 2026."]}]
